  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Beheer moeiteloos het menu van uw restaurant met Dash SaaS. ",
  "/Month": "/Maand",
  "/Year": "/Jaar",
  "Buy Now": "Koop nu",
  "View Live Demo": "Bekijk livedemo",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Dynamische aanbiedingen en promoties",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Verhoog uw omzet en trek meer klanten aan met onze functie voor aanbiedingsbeheer. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Efficiënte tafelschikkingen",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Optimaliseer uw eetruimte en stroomlijn uw activiteiten met onze tafelschikkingsfunctie. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Maatwerk en realtime updates",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Pas uw menu aan de unieke identiteit van uw restaurant aan met onze tools voor het maken van attributen en categorieën. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Verbeterde klantbetrokkenheid",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Breng uw klantenservice naar een hoger niveau met onze klantbeheertools. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Realtime frontend-updates",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "Met Dash SaaS zijn alle wijzigingen die u aanbrengt in uw menu, aanbiedingen of eettafelarrangementen direct zichtbaar aan de voorkant. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Waarom kiezen voor speciale modules",
  "for your business?": "voor uw bedrijf?",
  "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Met Dash kunt u al uw zakelijke functies gemakkelijk vanaf één locatie beheren",
